  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aceli Africa (RDEL ICF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aceli Africa provides loan guarantees and origination incentives to financial institutions, increasing investment in high-potential agribusinesses. Aceli also provides specific impact bonuses for investment in businesses that support food security, women, and climate smart agriculture.</narrative>
  </description>
